            <ArticleTitle>[Energy metabolic in patients with ischemic heart disease before and after heart surgery].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>17-21</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The study involved 85 patients with coronary heart disease (CHD). The parameters of metabolic status the actual food intake with the help of a new computer program, based on frequency method were investigated from patients with cardiovascular diseases. It was found a disbalanse of intake main food components and low physical activity in of patients.</AbstractText>
